
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Signup Successful | CapCentral</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #eef6ff 0%,
                    #f8fbff 50%,
                    #eefaf5 100%
                );

            color: #1f2937;
        }

        .success-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
        }

        .message-box {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            text-align: center;

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08),
                0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);

            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);

            animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out;
        }

        /* Success Icon */
        .success-icon {
            width: 82px;
            height: 82px;
            margin: 0 auto 26px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            background: #e9f9f0;
            border: 2px solid #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;

            color: #16a34a;
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 700;

            animation: popIn 0.5s ease-out;
        }

        .success-icon::before {
            content: "✓";
        }

        /* Brand */
        .brand {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #2563eb;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            line-height: 1.25;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #6b7280;
            max-width: 420px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .message {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* Information box */
        .email-notice {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 15px 18px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;

            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        .email-notice strong {
            color: #374151;
        }

        /* Button */
        .login-button {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            min-width: 190px;
            padding: 13px 28px;

            background: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff;

            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;

            border-radius: 10px;

            transition:
                background-color 0.2s ease,
                transform 0.2s ease,
                box-shadow 0.2s ease;

            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22);
        }

        .login-button:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 9px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.28);
        }

        .login-button:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eef0f3;

            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        /* Animations */
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(15px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes popIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: scale(0.7);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }

        /* Mobile */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 18px;
            }

            .message-box {
                padding: 38px 24px;
                border-radius: 16px;
            }

            .success-icon {
                width: 72px;
                height: 72px;
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }

            p {
                font-size: 15px;
            }

            .login-button {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <main class="success-wrapper">

        <section class="message-box">

            <div class="success-icon" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="brand">
                CapCentral
            </div>

            <h1>
                Signup Successful!
            </h1>

            <div class="message">
                <p>
                    Your account has been created successfully.
                    We've sent a verification link to your email address.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="email-notice">
                <strong>Almost there!</strong><br>
                Please check your inbox and click the verification link
                to activate your CapCentral account.
            </div>

            <a href="/login" class="login-button">
                Go to Login
            </a>

            <div class="footer">
                Thank you for joining CapCentral.
                <br>
                We're happy to have you with us.
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

</body>
</html>

